{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"monte-carlo-integration","title":"蒙特卡洛积分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/monte-carlo-integration","wordCount":1494,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"markov-chain-stationarity","title":"马氏链与平稳分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/markov-chain-stationarity","wordCount":1308,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"detailed-balance","title":"细致平衡与可逆性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/markov-chain-monte-carlo/foundations/detailed-balance","wordCount":1454,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>MCMC 这个名字由两半拼成，这一章把两半的地基分别打牢，再说明它们如何咬合。</p>\n<p>「蒙特卡洛」这一半解决的是「为什么能用随机样本算积分」。第一篇讲蒙特卡洛积分：把期望写成积分、用样本均值无偏估计它，误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衰减且与维度无关——这正是高维下它打败确定性求积的根本原因。但普通蒙特卡洛要求你能直接从目标分布采样，而后验分布恰恰采不出来，这就逼出了第二半。</p>\n<p>「马尔可夫链」这一半解决的是「采不出来时怎么办」。第二篇讲马氏链的平稳分布与遍历性：构造一条链，让它的平稳分布恰好是目标分布，跑得足够久之后链上的样本就近似来自目标分布。第三篇讲细致平衡——一个比平稳性更强、却更好验证的充分条件，它是后面所有采样器（MH、Gibbs、HMC）设计转移核时共同遵守的设计准则，把「我构造的链确实收敛到目标分布」从猜测变成可证明的事实。</p>\n<p>这三篇构成全 hub 的逻辑起点：<a href=\"../samplers/\">采样器</a> 章的每一个算法，本质都是「用细致平衡造一条命中目标分布的链，再用蒙特卡洛积分去估期望」。读懂这一章，后面的算法就只是在「怎么造提议、怎么走得快」上做文章。本章不重复 <a href=\"../../stochastic-processes/markov/markov-chains\">随机过程</a> 对马氏链的完整理论，只取构造采样器所需的最小内核。</p>\n"}